# Gumdrop Vale — Ink and Vellum
; The travelling theme, plus the three words only this document knows.
; `use:` makes the base an INHERITED layer, which is also what keeps #116's
; dead-declaration lint honest here: a shared theme deliberately styles words
; no single map uses, and spec 08 §6 exempts inherited layers for exactly that.
kind: theme
use: ../ink-and-vellum.theme.cd

[theme]
gumdrop-hills : fill=#d9caa5
licorice-forest : fill=#8f8a72
taffy-river : stroke=#5c7c85
